  description: "If you control a \"Six Samurai\" monster other than \"Tactical Trainer
    of the Six Samurai\", you can Special Summon this card (from your hand). You
    can only Special Summon \"Tactical Trainer of the Six Samurai\" once per turn
    this way. You can only use each of the following effects of \"Tactical Trainer
    of the Six Samurai\" once per turn. If this card is sent from the field to the
    GY: You can add 1 \"Six Strike\" card from your Deck or GY to your hand. A \"Six
    Samurai\" monster that was Synchro Summoned using this card gains this effect.\r\n\u25CF
    Monsters your opponent controls lose 500 ATK."
